	(text "System mode:\n\n  Off\n    - HVAC-12 not connected\n    - HVAC-18 not connected\n\n  Cooling\n    - HVAC-12 connected to HVAC-14\n    - HVAC-18 connected to HVAC-19\n    - HVAC-15 connected to HVAC-14 if fan auto\n\n  Heating\n    - HVAC-12 connected to HVAC-11\n    - HVAC-18 connected to HVAC-17\n    - HVAC-15 not connected if fan auto\n\n  Fan only mode\n    - HVAC-12 not connected\n    - HVAC-18 connected to HVAC-19"
